      "whatItDoes": "ZeroClaw is an agent runtime: a single Rust binary you configure and run as your own personal AI assistant. It talks to LLM providers such as Anthropic, OpenAI, Ollama and about 20 others, and reaches you through 30+ channels like Discord and Telegram.",
